# phoenix_js — Phoenix Channels + LiveView JS externs (repo-local)
#
# This library provides typed externs for the official Phoenix JS packages:
# - `phoenix` (Socket/Channel/Push)
# - `phoenix_live_view` (LiveSocket + hook types)
#
# Client builds (e.g. examples/todo-app/build-client.hxml) should use:
#   -lib phoenix_js
#
# Paths are rooted at the workspace via SCOPE_DIR so the library can be used
# from tests, examples and tools without depending on global haxelib state.

-cp ${SCOPE_DIR}/vendor/phoenix_js/src

# Library define for conditional compilation flags
-D phoenix_js=0.1.0

